---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="반려생활 도구 — emfls pet" description="오늘의 반려생활을 가볍게 돕는 emfls pet의 실용 도구입니다."><div class="tools-intro"><span class="eyebrow">PET LIFE TOOLS</span><h1>매일의 돌봄을<br /><em>조금 더 쉽게.</em></h1><p>반려생활을 위한 작은 보조 도구를 한곳에 모았어요.</p></div><div class="tool-grid"><a href="/tools/routine/" class="tool-card routine"><span class="tool-icon">✓</span><div><span class="eyebrow">TODAY</span><h2>Pet Routine</h2><p>오늘의 급여, 물, 산책, 놀이와 관리를 체크해요.</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span></a><a href="/tools/feeding/" class="tool-card feeding"><span class="tool-icon">◌</span><div><span class="eyebrow">REFERENCE</span><h2>급여량 참고 계산기</h2><p>제품 표시량을 기준으로 1회 급여량을 가늠해요.</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span></a></div></Layout>
<style>.tools-intro{padding:65px 0 40px}.tools-intro h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:16px 0}.tools-intro em{font-style:normal;color:#328a7c}.tools-intro p{color:#6d7d77}.tool-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.tool-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;min-height:200px;padding:28px;border-radius:22px;color:#243331}.tool-card>div{flex:1}.tool-card.routine{background:#dceee7}.tool-card.feeding{background:#f8e7d0}.tool-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:15px;background:#ffffff91;color:#287c70;font-size:27px;font-weight:700}.tool-card h2{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:12px 0 7px}.tool-card p{font-size:13px;color:#62736c;line-height:1.7}.arrow{font-size:22px;color:#287c70}@media(max-width:700px){.tools-intro{padding:40px 0 28px}.tools-intro h1{font-size:34px}.tool-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tool-card{min-height:170px;padding:22px}}</style>
